# harness_menu.pdl - GLOBAL harness rows, shown by the top taskbar's "harness" cell and in every editor book.
# 2026-11-11: this list is the confirmed-proof cases that recreate the grok handoff actions (generator tiles/char/restyle/cast/sheets, centroid crew, enter a house).
# House ratchets (py_lint, spawn_lint) and other games stay out of this dropdown. A book's own rows still come from @.apps/<book>/harness.pdl.
# HARNESS | id | page | kind | label | target | args | writes | confirm | note
# Cancel is not a row: every harness dropdown draws "- cancel -" with action void, same as the other toolbar menus.
HARNESS | proof_all         | * | CASE | run all      | proof_all         | - | - | no | make, test, silent proof video, doc, continue
HARNESS | generator_tiles   | * | CASE | gen tiles    | generator_tiles   | - | - | no | tile sheet proof from the 2026-11-05 handoff
HARNESS | generator_char    | * | CASE | gen char     | generator_char    | - | - | no | character sheet proof from the 2026-11-05 handoff
HARNESS | generator_restyle | * | CASE | gen restyle  | generator_restyle | - | - | no | restyle proof from the 2026-11-05 handoff
HARNESS | generator_cast    | * | CASE | gen cast     | generator_cast    | - | - | no | cast proof from the 2026-11-05 handoff
HARNESS | generator_sheets  | * | CASE | gen sheets   | generator_sheets  | - | - | no | sheet-tool proof from the 2026-11-05 handoff
HARNESS | centroid_crew     | * | CASE | crew         | centroid_crew     | - | - | no | skyland blueprint, raise, and crew proof
HARNESS | enter_house       | * | CASE | enter house  | enter_house       | - | - | no | shut door refuses, open door climbs one stair
